# Fixed pressure trades pressure rise for expansion
# Expectation: Acid/carbonate under 1 bar regulation should stay near 1 bar and increase gas volume or explicitly state the unsupported constraint.
register lv3
add v1 water 100mL
regulate v1 1bar 10mL
add v1 NaHCO3 0.001mol
add v1 HCl 0.002mol
measure v1 pressure
inspect v1
